; Smaragd Dash demo cave 4: water, fire and explosives (tools/democave.py
; plays it, with 4-water-fire-and-explosives.moves; tools/record-tour.sh
; films it). Acid and amoebas grow at GDash's own speed.
;
; The upper path, left to right: Rockford opens six cases below the path
; (a snap downwards); flying boulders and emeralds rise out and slide off the
; down-sloped brick, steel and dirt above the path into pockets. A bomb, laid
; next to explodable steel (here a bomb's explosion leaves space, not brick);
; meanwhile an amoeba and an amoeba 2 above meet: the amoeba 2 explodes, and
; both turn into emeralds. A rocket launcher: a rocket down a shaft blasts
; the brick at its bottom.
; The lower path, right to left: a ghost, let out next to Rockford, explodes
; into random things (its explosion misses the cells beside it); a nitro pack
; pushed into a pit explodes and opens a vault of explodable steel; a boulder
; pushed over lava is gone. Acid has eaten its way through dirt, water has
; flowed after it, and the cow shut in by the water has turned into a
; skeleton. Glued dirt under the path.
